8","state":"uploaded","size":359,"digest":"sha256:18d27fbf4ded63f34965197ad69afc9c04618f3e13571465c77507981ea8e153","download_count":137,"created_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:02Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/download/v1.36.5%2Bk3s1/sha256sum-arm.txt"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k3s-io/k3s/releases/assets/601314856","id":601314856,"node_id":"RA_kwDOCBPQbs4j11Yo","name":"sha256sum-arm64.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":365,"digest":"sha256:865827217151d808579683119d9da2835a851c5246863ab20ef8a3732ec6d7fe","download_count":9841,"created_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:02Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/download/v1.36.5%2Bk3s1/sha256sum-arm64.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k3s-io/k3s/tarball/v1.36.5+k3s1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k3s-io/k3s/zipball/v1.36.5+k3s1","body":"<!-- v1.36.5+k3s1 -->\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This release upgrades Traefik chart to v40.x which includes a breaking change for the ingress-nginx migration: the provider name changes from `kubernetesIngressNginx` to `kubernetesIngressNGINX`. Check https://github.com/traefik/traefik-helm-chart/releases/tag/v40.0.0 for more details\r\n\r\nThis release updates Kubernetes to v1.36.5, and fixes a number of issues.\r\n\r\nFor more details on what's new, see the [Kubernetes release notes](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-1.36.md#changelog-since-v1364).\r\n\r\n## Changes since v1.36.4+k3s1:\r\n\r\n* Bump rancher/mirrored-coredns-coredns image version [(#14534)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14534)\r\n* Bump gateway-api and traefik image versions for K3s 1.36 [(#14567)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14567)\r\n  * Bump Traefik image to 3.7.12 and gateway-api to 1.6.1\r\n* Bump Traefik to v3.7.13 [(#14610)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14610)\r\n* Bump google.golang.org/grpc to v1.83.2 for CVE-2026-84445 [(#14620)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14620)\r\n* Backports for 2026-09 [(#14632)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14632)\r\n  * Fix restore from compressed etcd snapshot #14528\r\n  * Enable seccomp in riscv64 builds #14529\r\n  * Use ginkgo CLI to run tests #14531\r\n  * Bump k3s-io/api to v0.2.0 #14570\r\n  * Servicelb multiple lbpools #14547\r\n  * Close minio.Object after read #14580\r\n  * Bump k3s-io/apis again #14589\r\n  * Fix --flannel-cni-conf not reaching the embedded flannel #14598\r\n  * Check-config: suppress colors when stdout is not a terminal #14595\r\n  * Fix deploy controller not re-applying manifests when mtime is pinned to the epoch #14568\r\n  * Bump etcd to v3.7.1-k3s3 for nonblocking logging support #14628\r\n  * Bump kine to v0.17.1 #14627\r\n* Require node password informer sync before using cache [(#14673)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14673)\r\n* Bump helm-controller [(#14685)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14685)\r\n* Bump k3s-io/kubernetes and Go references [(#14694)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14694)\r\n* Reject anonymous access to supervisor router (spegel/pprof/metrics) [(#14702)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14702)\r\n* Improve CA hash validation [(#14706)](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/pull/14706)\r\n\r\n## Embedded Component Versions\r\n| Component | Version |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Kubernetes | [v1.36.5](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-1.36.md#v1365) |\r\n| Kine | [v0.16.5](https://github.com/k3s-io/kine/releases/tag/v0.16.5) |\r\n| SQLite | [3.53.4](https://sqlite.org/releaselog/3_53_4.html) |\r\n| Etcd | [v3.6.14-k3s3](https://github.com/k3s-io/etcd/releases/tag/v3.6.14-k3s3) |\r\n| Containerd | [v2.3.4-k3s1.36](https://github.com/k3s-io/containerd/releases/tag/v2.3.4-k3s1.36) |\r\n| Runc | [v1.4.2](https://github.com/opencontainers/runc/releases/tag/v1.4.2) |\r\n| Flannel | [v0.28.4](https://github.com/flannel-io/flannel/releases/tag/v0.28.4) | \r\n| Metrics-server | [v0.9.0](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/metrics-server/releases/tag/v0.9.0) |\r\n| Traefik | [v3.7.13](https://github.com/traefik/traefik/releases/tag/v3.7.13) |\r\n| CoreDNS | [v1.14.7](https://github.com/coredns/coredns/releases/tag/v1.14.7) | \r\n| Helm-controller | [v0.17.9](https://github.com/k3s-io/helm-controller/releases/tag/v0.17.9) |\r\n| Local-path-provisioner | [v0.0.37](https://github.com/rancher/local-path-provisioner/releases/tag/v0.0.37) |\r\n\r\n## Helpful Links\r\nAs always, we welcome and appreciate feedback from our community of users. Please feel free to:\r\n- [Open issues here](https://github.com/rancher/k3s/issues/new/choose)\r\n- [Join our Slack channel](https://slack.rancher.io/)\r\n- [Check out our documentation](https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/) for guidance on how to get started or to dive deep into K3s.\r\n- [Read how you can contribute here](https://github.com/rancher/k3s/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n"}